&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is seeking an experienced Director of International Transportation to lead our first-mile and international transportation operations. Based in Fontana, CA, this role will be responsible for managing international freight from origin to U.S. warehouses, including ocean freight, air freight, customs clearance coordination, port operations, carrier/vendor management, transportation cost control, and overall service performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has strong experience in cross-border logistics, freight forwarding, international transportation, or 3PL operations, with the ability to manage both daily execution and strategic transportation resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage international first-mile transportation operations, primarily covering shipments from Asia/China to the United States.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage ocean, air, drayage, customs brokerage, and other logistics service provider resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage carrier/vendor performance, pricing, capacity, service levels, and contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee booking, container allocation, shipping schedules, customs clearance coordination, port pickup, and handoff to domestic trucking / U.S. warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize transportation routes and logistics solutions to reduce overall transportation costs and improve delivery efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor freight rates, market capacity, port conditions, and international logistics trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and improve SOPs, KPIs, cost-control mechanisms, and exception-management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate closely with warehouse operations, trucking, customer service, procurement, and overseas teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle major shipment exceptions, delays, customs issues, capacity shortages, and other operational escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and develop the international transportation team and support the company’s nationwide logistics expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
