&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in international logistics, freight forwarding, transportation, or 3PL operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of people management experience required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of ocean freight, air freight, customs clearance, port operations, container transportation, and U.S. logistics networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong carrier, freight forwarder, NVOCC, customs broker, or transportation vendor management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation, cost analysis, and transportation resource development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing high-volume international shipments strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and cross-functional coordination skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Supply Chain, Logistics, Business, or related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in Mandarin Chinese strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
