&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;岗位职责&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;1、负责海外公司财务相关的内外沟通与协调工作；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;2、负责海外公司当地第三方财务代理，银行等的选择，沟通和审核；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;3、负责海外公司的财务筹划工作，含资金、风控，流程，预算等；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;4、负责海外公司财务数据分析，为经营决策提供相关依据；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;5、负责海外公司的审计、报税对接工作；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;6、负责海外公司财务网络的搭建和控制；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;7、完成领导布置的其他工作；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;要求：&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;1、教育水平：本科以上学历，西语+财会综合背景优先；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;2、工作经历：有2年以上财务工作经验，当地财务工作经验优先，有团队管理经验优先&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;3、精通英语和西语，包括书面和口语，有留学生活经历优先&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;能力要求：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;1、具有较强的工作热情和责任感，对业务及新事务有强烈的好奇心和探究精神，愿意深入一线了解业务，探讨业财方案；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;2、学习能力强，主动了解不同财经法律法规和税收政策及相关账务的处理方法。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;3. 具有较强的判断和决策力、人际沟通和协调能力、计划与执行能力；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;4、原则性强，工作踏实、认真，思维敏捷、严谨&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;article class=&quot;4ever-article&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-type=&quot;leaf&quot;&gt;base地：墨西哥墨州 华人优先&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsabilidades del puesto：&lt;br&gt;1. Encargarse de la comunicación y coordinación interna y externa relacionada con las finanzas de la empresa en el extranjero.&lt;br&gt;2. Seleccionar, comunicarse y auditar a los agentes financieros tercerizados locales, entidades bancarias y otros proveedores de la empresa en el extranjero.&lt;br&gt;3. Realizar la planificación financiera de la empresa en el extranjero, incluidos la gestión de fondos, control de riesgos, procedimientos operativos y presupuestos.&lt;br&gt;4. Analizar los datos financieros de la empresa en el extranjero y proporcionar fundamentos para las decisiones operativas.&lt;br&gt;5. Coordinar los trabajos de auditoría y declaración de impuestos de la empresa en el extranjero.&lt;br&gt;6. Establecer y controlar la red financiera de la empresa en el extranjero.&lt;br&gt;7. Cumplir otras tareas asignadas por la dirección.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requisitos del puesto&lt;br&gt;1. Formación académica: Licenciatura o superior. &amp;nbsp;Se dará prioridad a candidatos con formación combinada en idioma español y contabilidad y finanzas.&lt;br&gt;2. Experiencia laboral: Más de 2 años de experiencia en finanzas. Se valorará experiencia laboral en finanzas locales y experiencia en gestión de equipos.&lt;br&gt;3. Dominio avanzado del inglés y español, tanto escrito como oral. Se dará prioridad a candidatos con experiencia de estudios en el extranjero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Características personales&lt;br&gt;1. Gran entusiasmo y sentido de responsabilidad en el trabajo. Curiosidad e iniciativa para conocer negocios y nuevos temas;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;2. Alta capacidad de aprendizaje, con iniciativa para conocer distintas normativas económicas, financieras y fiscales, así como métodos de tratamiento contable correspondientes.&lt;br&gt;3. Fuerte capacidad de juicio y toma de decisiones, comunicación interpersonal y coordinación, planificación y ejecución.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lugar de trabajo: Estado de México, México&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Responsabilidades clave (Key Responsibilities)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desarrollar, gestionar y optimizar proveedores de paquetería e-commerce (Estafeta, FedEx, Paqueteexpress, etc.)&lt;br&gt;Elaborar y optimizar estructuras tarifarias (price table / tarifas) para envíos de paquetería, asegurando competitividad en costo y servicio&lt;br&gt;Liderar negociaciones y gestión de desempeño con carriers (SLA, tiempos de entrega, costos, incidencias)&lt;br&gt;Expandir y consolidar la red de proveedores de transporte de paquetería&lt;br&gt;Diseñar soluciones logísticas óptimas para e-commerce (B2C, fulfillment, última milla)&lt;br&gt;Analizar datos logísticos (costos, tiempos, tasa de incidencias) para mejorar eficiencia operativa y experiencia del cliente&lt;br&gt;Coordinar con áreas internas (almacén, operaciones, servicio al cliente) para optimizar el proceso end-to-end&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requisitos (Requirements)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;+10 años de experiencia en logística e-commerce en México, enfocado en paquetería (parcel)&lt;br&gt;Experiencia comprobable en empresas como Estafeta / FedEx / Paqueteexpress en áreas comerciales o cuentas clave&lt;br&gt;Dominio en diseño de estructuras tarifarias de paquetería (pricing / rate card)&lt;br&gt;Experiencia sólida en operación e-commerce (B2C, one-piece fulfillment), preferente sobre transporte de carga completa (FTL/LTL)&lt;br&gt;Red de contactos con proveedores de paquetería y fuerte capacidad de negociación&lt;br&gt;Alta capacidad analítica y enfoque en optimización de costos y KPIs&lt;br&gt;Español fluido; inglés es un plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competencias clave (Key Competencies)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Estrategia de costos y pricing&lt;br&gt;Gestión y desarrollo de proveedores (Vendor Management)&lt;br&gt;Conocimiento profundo de logística e-commerce&lt;br&gt;Habilidades de negociación y visión comercial&lt;br&gt;Análisis de datos y resolución de problemas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deseable (Plus)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experiencia en e-commerce cross-border o modelo fulfillment + última milla&lt;br&gt;Experiencia en implementación desde cero de redes logísticas&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About YQN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;YQN is a fast-growing, technology-driven international logistics platform, and we&#39;re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;HR Business Partner (HRBP)&lt;/strong&gt; to support our growing U.S. operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this role, you will partner closely with business leaders and employees on workforce planning, employee relations, performance management, talent development, and day-to-day HR support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business leaders on workforce planning, organizational needs, and people-related priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance to managers on performance management, employee relations, and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee engagement, retention, and career development initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle employee concerns and support workplace investigations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with recruiting and HR teams on hiring, onboarding, policies, and HR programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure HR practices comply with applicable U.S. federal and state employment laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve HR processes and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3–5+ years of HR experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including HRBP, HR Generalist, or a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with managers and supporting frontline or operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong employee relations, communication, coaching, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of U.S. employment laws and HR best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in Chinese speaking and reading is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in warehouse, logistics, manufacturing, or distribution is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off (PTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visa sponsorship for qualified candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About YQN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is a fast-growing, technology-driven international logistics platform offering FCL, LCL, air freight, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, and more. We are expanding our U.S. warehouse network and are looking for an HR Coordinator to support our Romeoville, IL (SPR) warehouse operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, on-site role split roughly evenly between recruiting and staffing (temporary labor) management. You will keep the warehouse staffed with the right people, coordinate with staffing agency partners, and support site leaders on day-to-day HR needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruiting (about 50%)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screen resumes, conduct phone screens, and schedule interviews for warehouse associate, lead, and supervisor roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate interviews with site managers, follow up on feedback, and move candidates through each stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support offers, background checks, and onboarding paperwork for new hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep candidate and hiring data up to date in Greenhouse and internal recruiting reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Staffing Management (about 50%)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with staffing agencies to fill daily and weekly temporary labor needs based on Operations&#39; headcount plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track temporary worker attendance, fill rate, and turnover, and follow up with agencies on gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile agency invoices against approved hours and flag discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate temp-to-hire conversions and onboarding with site leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support site safety and onboarding training for new and temporary workers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of experience in recruiting, HR coordination, or staffing agency coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in warehousing, logistics, or high-volume hourly hiring preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and follow-up skills; able to manage many open requests at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with Excel and applicant tracking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator with candidates, managers, and vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandarin speaking preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; On-site in Romeoville, IL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay:&lt;/strong&gt; $20 – $25 per hour, based on experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Medical/Dental/Vision Insurance, 401(K), PTO, Paid sick leave. Visa sponsorship available for qualified candidates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About YQN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, offering comprehensive international logistics services, including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail service, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo service, port of destination services, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are designed to apply the internet and digital technology to visualize and optimize cross-border supply chain logistics to achieve the same efficiency and convenience as express delivery. ‘Simple shipping and easy freight’ is the mission of us. We have developed strategic cooperative partnerships with leading ocean carriers and logistics service providers such as COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, Sinotrans, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have built up the ocean and air transport network from China to the world and introduced a series of innovative product offerings such as the First-class FCL, First-class LCL, First-class Air Freight, realizing online quotation, online order, online logistics tracking, and other abundant functions, to build a more efficient and intelligent cross-border supply chain logistics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth and timely freight process flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate and timely data entry into our operating system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and trace shipments as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize Process Monitors and Workflows daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely movement and delivery of freight to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure documents are sent to the customer or broker in a timely manner for customs purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate and timely client invoicing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact with our customers in arranging their shipments, exceeding customer service expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to maintaining strong relationships with suppliers (airlines, trucking companies, and others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet compliance requirements at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand department process flow, constantly looking for areas of improved efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all customers&#39; standard operating procedures are followed and updated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseas communications, timely responses to emails and requests (internal and external)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a similar role is highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent customer service and client relations skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick critical thinking and problem-solving abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use computers, software, and other technology for inventory and communication purposes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, written, and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a passion for logistics and a desire to grow with our fantastic team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freight forwarding experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in Chinese speaking and reading is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Type: Full-time, On-site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay: $20 - $25/hour&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits: Medical/Dental/Vision Insurance, 401(K), PTO&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, offering comprehensive international logistics services, including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail service, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo service, port of destination services, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are designed to apply the internet and digital technology to visualize and optimize cross-border supply chain logistics to achieve the same efficiency and convenience as express delivery. ‘Simple shipping and easy freight’ is the mission of YQN. We have developed strategic cooperative partnerships with leading ocean carriers and logistics service providers such as COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, Sinotrans, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN operates over 10 large-scale warehouses across five U.S. states, totaling approximately 7 million square feet. Our trucking network is fully asset-light, with transportation capacity provided by third-party carriers and trucking vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking &lt;strong data-start=&quot;104&quot; data-end=&quot;155&quot;&gt;recent graduates and early-career professionals&lt;/strong&gt; who are interested in building a career in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;supply chain management, logistics, and warehouse operations&lt;/strong&gt; to join us as Logistics Coordination Trainee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
