&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About YQN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, offering comprehensive international logistics services, including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail service, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo service, port of destination services, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are designed to apply the internet and digital technology to visualize and optimize cross-border supply chain logistics to achieve the same efficiency and convenience as express delivery. ‘Simple shipping and easy freight’ is the mission of YQNLINK. We have developed strategic cooperative partnerships with leading ocean carriers and logistics service providers such as COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, Sinotrans, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have built up the ocean and air transport network from China to the world and introduced a series of innovative product offerings such as the First-class FCL, First-class LCL, First-class Air Freight, realizing online quotation, online order, online logistics tracking and other abundant functions, to build a more efficient and intelligent cross-border supply chain logistics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Regional Operation Director is responsible for overseeing and optimizing the operational performance of our warehouse and distribution facilities. This role will provide strategic leadership to ensure operational efficiency, compliance, safety, and continuous improvement, aligning with YQN’s mission and growth objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Lead and manage all operational activities, including warehouse operations, transportation, and overall supply chain functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Develop and execute regional strategies to improve productivity, cost efficiency, and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Oversee and ensure compliance with company policies, safety standards, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Build and mentor a high-performing regional operations team; promote a culture of accountability, teamwork, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Monitor and analyze key performance indicators (KPIs) to identify opportunities for operational improvements and cost savings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Collaborate closely with other regional teams and senior leadership to align operational goals and share best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Establish and maintain strong relationships with key clients and partners in the region to ensure high customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Manage regional budgets and ensure financial targets are met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Support new business development initiatives and expansion projects within the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
