&lt;p&gt;- Bachelor’s degree in Supply Chain Management, Business Administration, Operations Management, or a related field; MBA or advanced degree preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Minimum 5&amp;nbsp;years of progressive experience in warehouse operations or supply chain management, with at least 5 years in a senior leadership role overseeing multi-site operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong knowledge of warehouse, distribution, and transportation processes and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
