&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1jjwfji&quot; data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;385&quot;&gt;About YQN&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;684&quot;&gt;YQN is a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, providing comprehensive cross-border logistics solutions including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail transportation, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo services, and destination port services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;1086&quot;&gt;Leveraging internet and digital technologies, YQN is transforming global logistics by making cross-border supply chains more visible, efficient, and intelligent. Through strategic partnerships with leading logistics providers and carriers, including COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, and Sinotrans, YQN has established a comprehensive global transportation network connecting China with markets worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1147&quot;&gt;Our mission is simple: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1147&quot;&gt;&quot;Simple Shipping, Easy Freight.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
