&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, offering comprehensive international logistics services, including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail service, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo service, port of destination services, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are designed to apply the internet and digital technology to visualize and optimize cross-border supply chain logistics to achieve the same efficiency and convenience as express delivery. ‘Simple shipping and easy freight’ is the mission of YQN. We have developed strategic cooperative partnerships with leading ocean carriers and logistics service providers such as COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, Sinotrans, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Start your career in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with YQN! Our Supply Chain Operation Coordinator is designed for recent graduates and early-career professionals who want hands-on experience across&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;inventory management, logistics and transportation&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside experienced professionals, develop practical supply chain skills, and gain exposure to different areas of our operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support daily warehouse and distribution center operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with inventory tracking, cycle counts, and quality control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support order fulfillment, shipping, and returns processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze operational data and assist with performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional teams to solve operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in process improvement projects and special assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow company safety and operational procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Supply Chain Management or related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;communication, organization, problem-solving, and teamwork skills&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and ability to work in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Excel and Office&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn new systems and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in supply chain, logistics, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandarin/English bilingual skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Gain:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in supply chain and warehouse operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship from experienced logistics professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to end-to-end supply chain processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;analytical, operational, and leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth opportunities in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain, Logistics, and Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Potential advancement into roles in management or quality control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Range: $20 - $25/hr&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits: Medical/Dental/Vision Insurance, 401(K), PTO&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, offering comprehensive international logistics services, including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail service, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo service, port of destination services, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are designed to apply the internet and digital technology to visualize and optimize cross-border supply chain logistics to achieve the same efficiency and convenience as express delivery. ‘Simple shipping and easy freight’ is the mission of YQN. We have developed strategic cooperative partnerships with leading ocean carriers and logistics service providers such as COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, Sinotrans, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have built up the ocean and air transport network from China to the world and introduced a series of innovative product offerings such as the First-class FCL, First-class LCL, First-class Air Freight, realizing online quotation, online orders, online logistics tracking, and other abundant functions, to build a more efficient and intelligent cross-border supply chain logistics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Project Specialist, you will have the opportunity to gain hands-on experience in equipment testing and analysis. You’ll collaborate with experienced engineers, contribute to real projects, and gain valuable insight into how engineering principles are applied in a professional setting. International students are welcome to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the full implementation and follow-up of warehouse automation projects, including equipment installation, testing, and operation monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project progress and communicate with engineers, vendors, and warehouse teams to ensure timely execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help with on-site troubleshooting, basic inspections, and simple maintenance work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data collection and documentation, and assist in optimizing warehouse operation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in project acceptance and post-implementation maintenance to ensure stable equipment performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New graduates are welcome to apply! Bachelor&#39;s degree in Mechanical/Electrical Engineering or a related field is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English and Chinese are preferred.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Hands-on skills and basic machine tool skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, coordination, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team spirit and leadership potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, multitasking environment with flexibility and adaptability. Proficiency in data analysis, MS office and report writing is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Compensation Package: $70k - $100k/yr&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;401(k)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dental insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paid time off&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vision insurance&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN is a leading one-stop international logistics online services platform, offering comprehensive international logistics services, including FCL, LCL, air freight, rail service, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, cargo insurance, bulk cargo service, port of destination services, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are designed to apply the internet and digital technology to visualize and optimize cross-border supply chain logistics to achieve the same efficiency and convenience as express delivery. ‘Simple shipping and easy freight’ is the mission of YQN. We have developed strategic cooperative partnerships with leading ocean carriers and logistics service providers such as COSCO Shipping, Maersk Line, Sinotrans, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN operates over 10 large-scale warehouses across five U.S. states, totaling approximately 7 million square feet. Our trucking network is fully asset-light, with transportation capacity provided by third-party carriers and trucking vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Trucking Capacity Manager to oversee nationwide trucking capacity, vendor management, pricing, and transportation performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage nationwide trucking capacity to support YQN&#39;s U.S. warehouse network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source, develop, and maintain relationships with trucking companies, carriers, brokers, and owner-operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish primary and backup carriers for key lanes and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage transportation capacity for local trucking, FTL, LTL, linehaul, and warehouse transfers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor carrier performance, including on-time delivery, service quality, pricing, and capacity reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize transportation costs and reduce reliance on expensive spot-market capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with warehouse and operations teams to resolve capacity shortages and transportation issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain carrier compliance, insurance, FMCSA/DOT documentation, and vendor records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trucking SOPs, KPIs, and vendor performance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of trucking, transportation, carrier management, freight brokerage, or logistics experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing third-party trucking carriers and transportation vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong carrier sourcing, rate negotiation, and vendor management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the U.S. trucking market and transportation pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing transportation across multiple locations or regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with drayage, FTL, LTL, linehaul, or 3PL transportation preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing carrier network is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in Chinese speaking and reading is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, negotiation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay&lt;/strong&gt;: 70k - 90k per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;- Medical/Dental/Vision Insurance, PTO, 401K&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About YQN Logistics&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;YQN Logistics is a technology-driven international logistics platform dedicated to making global shipping simpler and more efficient. We provide integrated logistics solutions, including ocean freight (FCL/LCL), air freight, rail transportation, trucking, customs clearance, warehousing, and cargo insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through digital technology and a global logistics network, we help businesses streamline supply chain operations, improve shipment visibility, and manage logistics more efficiently. Our mission is &lt;strong&gt;“Simple Shipping, Easy Freight.”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team and contribute to the smooth operation of our warehouse and logistics network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Position Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented and organized &lt;strong&gt;Warehouse Administrative Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt; to support daily warehouse administration, operational coordination, record management, and facility-related activities. This role serves as a key point of coordination between warehouse operations, internal departments, vendors, and external service providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has strong organizational and communication skills, is comfortable working with spreadsheets and operational data, and can efficiently manage multiple administrative tasks in a fast-paced logistics environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Warehouse Administrative Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain accurate warehouse records, operational documents, inventory-related reports, and administrative files.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist with data entry, document verification, report preparation, and routine updates in warehouse management systems (WMS), ERP platforms, or other internal systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organize and maintain records related to warehouse supplies, equipment, facility maintenance, and daily operational activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support administrative processes to ensure warehouse operations run smoothly and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Operations Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with warehouse supervisors and internal teams to track operational requests, resolve administrative issues, and ensure timely follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist with monitoring warehouse supplies, equipment, and facility-related needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help coordinate maintenance, repairs, installations, and other facility service requests with external vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track task progress, maintain follow-up records, and escalate outstanding issues when necessary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Vendor and Cross-Functional Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate with suppliers, maintenance contractors, property management teams, and other service providers regarding service requests, scheduling, quotations, and follow-ups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate purchasing requests, delivery arrangements, and expense documentation in accordance with company procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with warehouse operations, procurement, finance, and management teams to support daily business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain clear and professional communication to ensure requests are addressed accurately and on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Data Management and Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and update spreadsheets, trackers, and operational reports to support management decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review administrative data and documentation for accuracy, completeness, and consistency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify opportunities to improve recordkeeping, task tracking, and administrative workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support special projects and additional administrative tasks as assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Supply Chain Management, Logistics, Operations Management, or a related field preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous experience in warehouse administration, logistics coordination, office administration, procurement support, or a similar role is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office, particularly Excel, Word, and Outlook; experience with ERP or warehouse management systems is advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to coordinate effectively with internal teams and external vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to maintain accurate records, follow up on outstanding tasks, and solve routine operational problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-motivated, dependable, adaptable, and comfortable working in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to work onsite at the warehouse location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience coordinating warehouse facilities, maintenance, purchasing, equipment, or vendor services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with inventory documentation, purchase orders, invoices, expense tracking, or operational reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bilingual communication skills, particularly Chinese and English, are a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Type: Full-time, On-site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay: $20 - $25/hour&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits: Medical/Dental/Vision Insurance, 401(K), PTO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

