&lt;li&gt;At least 4 years of experience in high-volume warehouse management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profound knowledge of the logistics sector with a network of logistics service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership, influence, organizational, communication, interpersonal, and teamwork capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in Chinese speaking and reading is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
